# E3a and the lacuna translation raises for a value read to no effect: 1.0
# moved b and tags out of the optional struct q. The hand-written backward
# lens writes q, with b and tags, only where the instance has a q, and lists
# no lacuna for them: where q is absent, b and tags are read, but no field
# that reads them is written, so translation sets them aside (cause lost).
# The fate section records the readers that decide it.
